d temporary diagnostic logs.","limitations":["The lifecycle collector cannot report failed services through systemd because Alpine uses OpenRC; direct OpenRC status and successful behavior nevertheless show radiusd healthy.","The retained RADIUS test logs were inventoried, but their contents and permissions were not captured, so any sensitivity of those files cannot be determined.","The exact secret and credential values were appropriately redacted; dedication and correctness are inferred from the node2-specific random-secret configuration and successful positive/negative tests."]}
